  "description": "FRAMESET\n\nSizes 1 size 26\" x 457mm/45cm/18\"\n\nMaterial Alloy, 6061 TIG welded\n2x rear dropout eyelets, 1x rear fender eyelet, rear rack mounts\n\nFork Steel, 28.6mm/1 1/8\" Threaded for Quill, TIG welded, 2x eyelets\n\nWHEELSET\n\nRims Alloy double-wall, 26\" x 36H x 13G\n\nSpokes 36H x 13G UCP w/brass nipples\nTires 26 x 2.40, S/V, Wanda\n\nEXTRAS\n\nKickstand Rear mount, adjustable, aluminum alloy\nRear Carrier Steel. Battery holder & carrier, elastic tie-down strap\nAlloy\n\nLight(s) Front (4x AAA) + Rear (2x AA), batteries included\n\nFenders Steel fenders w/alloy stays\n\nRecommended Weight Limit 220lbs\n\nDRIVETRAIN\n\nRear Derailleur Shimano Tourney 7S\nShifters Shimano Tourney Thumb Shifter (push/pull) 7S, SL-TX50-7R\nCrankset Prowheel 170mm x 42T, alum arms, steel chainring, no logos\nChain KMC 3/32\" x 118L\nBB Steel sealed cartridge, 68mm x 126mm\nFreewheel/Cog Shimano 7-speed 14-28 (14-16-18-20-22-24-28)\n\nCOMPONENTS\n\nHeadset Threaded, steel, 1 1/8\" (28.6mm)\n\nBrakes JAX Mechanical disc Front & Rear, 160mm\n\nHandlebars Alloy low-rise, 610mmW x 40mm rise\n\nGrips Retrospec Comfort\n\nStem Alloy quill, single-bolt clamp\n\nSaddle Retrospec Comfort w/springs\n\nSeatpost Alloy w/integrated micro-adjust clamp, 28.6 x 300mm\n\nSeatpost Clamp Alloy QR\n\nPedals High Impact, Reinforced Nylon Resin Platform, 9/16\"\n\nE-POWER SYSTEM\n\n36V/350W Motor Brushless rear hub motor, 9-pin connector. MXUS\n\nDrive Mode, Display PAS/thumb-push throttle-Left side, speed sensor, LED handlebar-mount display panel w/6 assistance levels, w/Start-Aid 6kph (~4mph). Bigstone E300 Display Head.\n\nController Yelchm Technology\n\nCharge Time (empty to full) 10.4Ah battery (350 & 500W): 5-6 hours",
